  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b15bc1af5fb2391c",
      "translationZh": "自从 Stable Diffusion 席卷世界，人们就在寻找更多控制生成过程结果的办法。ControlNet 提供了一个极简接口，让用户能在很大程度上定制生成过程。有了 ControlNet，用户可以轻松用不同的空间上下文来约束生成：深度图、分割图、涂鸦、关键点等等！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84a9243372d66cd7",
      "translationZh": "我们可以把一幅卡通画变成连贯得不可思议的写实照片。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b95ae1b3bd7c779",
      "translationZh": "写实版 Lofi Girl",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "423db9e36d1a5452",
      "translationZh": "甚至可以让它当你的室内设计师。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bb725005055412c",
      "translationZh": "之前",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b68fe5510851da3",
      "translationZh": "之后",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b0c93b7145b8d95",
      "translationZh": "你也可以把草图涂鸦变成艺术画作。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bb725005055412c",
      "translationZh": "之前",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b68fe5510851da3",
      "translationZh": "之后",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c405a9d564130f16",
      "translationZh": "还能让一些著名 logo 活过来。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bb725005055412c",
      "translationZh": "之前",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b68fe5510851da3",
      "translationZh": "之后",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea35ef1a61f58e56",
      "translationZh": "有了 ControlNet，一切皆有可能 🌠",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a5f868ba2cba102",
      "translationZh": "本博文先介绍 StableDiffusionControlNetPipeline，然后展示它如何应用于各种控制条件。开始掌控吧！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "48718c55f4680dae",
      "translationZh": "ControlNet：太长不看版",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef0d5ebf64583cc8",
      "translationZh": "ControlNet 由 Lvmin Zhang 和 Maneesh Agrawala 在《Adding Conditional Control to Text-to-Image Diffusion Models》中提出。它引入了一个框架，支持作为 Stable Diffusion 等扩散模型附加条件的各种空间上下文。diffusers 的实现改编自原始源代码。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5434f6c2926503d8",
      "translationZh": "训练 ControlNet 包括以下步骤：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d260301d4221ab53",
      "translationZh": "克隆扩散模型（如 Stable Diffusion 的潜在 UNet）的预训练参数（称为“可训练副本”），同时单独保留一份预训练参数（“锁定副本”）。这样做是为了让锁定副本保存从大数据集中学到的海量知识，而可训练副本用于学习任务相关的部分。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b9a1c859bea8c6e",
      "translationZh": "可训练副本与锁定副本通过“零卷积”层连接（更多信息见这里），这些层作为 ControlNet 框架的一部分被优化。这是一种训练技巧：在训练新条件时保住冻结模型已学到的语义。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74b2140c44c523ae",
      "translationZh": "直观地看，训练 ControlNet 是这样：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6adc3d0537047c10",
      "translationZh": "图示取自这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28184f909e5d5d2a",
      "translationZh": "ControlNet 式训练的训练集样本如下（附加条件通过边缘图提供）：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c39123805ffb4e2",
      "translationZh": "提示",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d03604aceced5b76",
      "translationZh": "原图",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a97086a4aca7ae2d",
      "translationZh": "条件",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5fe8c323395bd06e",
      "translationZh": "“鸟”",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4810b1b7f40e4e88",
      "translationZh": "同样，如果我们用语义分割图作为 ControlNet 的条件，训练样本会是这样：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c39123805ffb4e2",
      "translationZh": "提示",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d03604aceced5b76",
      "translationZh": "原图",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a97086a4aca7ae2d",
      "translationZh": "条件",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38c118084ad215e7",
      "translationZh": "“大房子”",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5733dbb74661805e",
      "translationZh": "每种新类型的条件都需要训练一份新的 ControlNet 权重。论文提出了 8 种不同的条件模型，Diffusers 全部支持！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e76e343ec847ae5",
      "translationZh": "推理时，既需要预训练扩散模型的权重，也需要训练好的 ControlNet 权重。例如，使用 Stable Diffusion v1-5 加一个 ControlNet 检查点，比只用原 Stable Diffusion 模型大约多 7 亿参数——这让 ControlNet 的推理稍显吃内存。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd2a76713d5bc622",
      "translationZh": "由于预训练扩散模型在训练中被锁定，换用不同条件时只需替换 ControlNet 参数。这使得在一个应用中部署多套 ControlNet 权重相当简单，下文将看到。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e208e8bfe9f506d8",
      "translationZh": "StableDiffusionControlNetPipeline",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c9c2e2e6ffb35e5",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，我们要大力感谢社区贡献者 Takuma Mori 领导了 ControlNet 与 Diffusers 的集成 ❤️。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a071cf80a371ff62",
      "translationZh": "要体验 ControlNet，Diffusers 提供了与其他 pipeline 类似的 StableDiffusionControlNetPipeline。它的核心是 controlnet 参数：我们可以提供某个训练好的 ControlNetModel 实例，同时保持预训练扩散模型权重不变。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4df0fcab24701193",
      "translationZh": "本博文将用 StableDiffusionControlNetPipeline 探索不同用例。我们要演示的第一个 ControlNet 模型是 Canny 模型——这是最受欢迎的模型之一，你在网上看到的许多惊艳图片就出自它。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a806c2cc2de58798",
      "translationZh": "欢迎用这个 Colab Notebook 运行下文各节的代码片段。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "596eff6e5290ece5",
      "translationZh": "开始前，先确保装好了所有必要的库：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edfaafad75c1918a",
      "translationZh": "要根据所选 ControlNet 处理不同的条件，还需要安装一些额外依赖：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6910bd404b0f318",
      "translationZh": "OpenCV",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "576c6ca2181e939c",
      "translationZh": "controlnet-aux——一套简单的 ControlNet 预处理模型合集",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc99e6e7e1d2ba98",
      "translationZh": "本例我们将使用名画《戴珍珠耳环的少女》。先下载图像看看：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dccae792461b2866",
      "translationZh": "接下来，把图像送入 canny 预处理器：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7f056a18572b2f3",
      "translationZh": "可以看到，它本质上就是边缘检测：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "311cb4929c92a14e",
      "translationZh": "现在加载 runwaylml/stable-diffusion-v1-5 以及 canny 边缘的 ControlNet 模型。模型以半精度（torch.dtype）加载，实现快速且省内存的推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abbee26b5b69233d",
      "translationZh": "我们不使用 Stable Diffusion 默认的 PNDMScheduler，而是用当前最快的扩散模型调度器之一 UniPCMultistepScheduler。选择改进的调度器能大幅缩短推理时间——本例中我们把推理步数从 50 降到 20，图像生成质量基本不变。关于调度器的更多信息见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1adf282ee8f831ce",
      "translationZh": "我们不把 pipeline 直接加载到 GPU，而是启用智能 CPU 卸载，用 enable_model_cpu_offload 函数实现。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f5d9cbb668c1752",
      "translationZh": "记住，推理时扩散模型（如 Stable Diffusion）不止一个模型组件，而是多个组件按顺序运行。带 ControlNet 的 Stable Diffusion：先用 CLIP 文本编码器，然后是扩散 unet 与 controlnet，接着 VAE 解码器，最后跑安全检查器。大多数组件在扩散过程中只运行一次，因此不必一直占据 GPU 显存。启用智能模型卸载后，每个组件只在需要时才载入 GPU，从而在不显著拖慢推理的前提下大幅节省显存。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed5c8627b593fc1d",
      "translationZh": "注意：运行 enable_model_cpu_offload 时，不要再用 .to(\"cuda\") 手动把 pipeline 移到 GPU——启用 CPU 卸载后，pipeline 会自动管理 GPU 显存。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ead91491c006a94",
      "translationZh": "最后，我们要充分利用出色的 FlashAttention/xformers 注意力层加速，启用它！如果这条命令在你那里不工作，可能是 xformers 没装好；这时跳过下面这行代码即可。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eeffdbbe50e6f382",
      "translationZh": "现在可以运行 ControlNet pipeline 了！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c38dba1c00f63243",
      "translationZh": "我们仍然提供提示词来引导图像生成，就像平常的 Stable Diffusion 图生图 pipeline。不过 ControlNet 让我们对生成图像的控制多得多——可以用刚创建的 canny 边缘图像控制生成图像的精确构图。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c82f557826a3f0ac",
      "translationZh": "看看当代名人们若为这幅 17 世纪的画作摆姿势会是什么样，一定很有趣。用 ControlNet 很容易做到：只要把这些名人的名字加进提示词！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1197d3fa9d41486",
      "translationZh": "先创建一个简单的辅助函数，把图像排成网格显示。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5006e62bf68f068f",
      "translationZh": "接着定义输入提示，并设置随机种子以便复现。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65faff919bbb50e9",
      "translationZh": "最后运行 pipeline 并展示图像！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75b517afaf4de02f",
      "translationZh": "ControlNet 也能毫不费力地与微调结合！例如，我们可以用 DreamBooth 微调一个模型，然后用它把自己渲染进不同场景。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b42c93bfbeadda91",
      "translationZh": "本文将用我们心爱的 Mr Potato Head（土豆先生）为例，展示 ControlNet 与 DreamBooth 的结合。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "582e23b9e25bb232",
      "translationZh": "我们可以用同一个 ControlNet；不过这次不加载 Stable Diffusion 1.5，而是把 Mr Potato Head 模型装进 pipeline——它是用 Dreambooth 以土豆先生概念微调过的 Stable Diffusion 模型 🥔",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92cdb6936a029b2a",
      "translationZh": "再运行一遍上面的命令，ControlNet 保持不变！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74e0fc382e57d4dd",
      "translationZh": "现在让土豆先生为约翰内斯·维米尔摆姿势吧！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cd8a91769d484b3",
      "translationZh": "看得出土豆先生不是最合适的候选人，但他尽了最大努力，相当不错地抓住了些许精髓 🍟",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b610bfc18378eca",
      "translationZh": "ControlNet 另一个独有的应用是：可以从一幅图像中取出姿势，复用它来生成姿势完全相同的另一幅图像。下一个例子，我们要用 Open Pose ControlNet 教超级英雄们做瑜伽！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7af3b2c9339c11ba",
      "translationZh": "首先，需要一些人们做瑜伽的图像：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9909f1aff2970714",
      "translationZh": "现在用 controlnet_aux 里现成的 OpenPose 预处理器提取瑜伽姿势。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ba9cfbc090f83d6",
      "translationZh": "要用这些瑜伽姿势生成新图像，创建一个 Open Pose ControlNet。我们将生成一些超级英雄图像，但姿势用上面展示的瑜伽姿势。出发 🚀",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14169411d6f481de",
      "translationZh": "瑜伽时间到！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "643d66e0c7521ce6",
      "translationZh": "组合多个条件",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea7c5eb558f2b22e",
      "translationZh": "多个 ControlNet 条件可以组合用于一次图像生成。给 pipeline 的构造函数传一个 ControlNet 列表，并在 __call__ 时传入对应的条件列表。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee1852d5b0582ab8",
      "translationZh": "组合条件时，对条件做遮罩避免重叠会很有帮助。本例中，我们对 canny 图的中间部分做了遮罩，因为姿势条件位于那里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f36f626c5941129",
      "translationZh": "调整 controlnet_conditioning_scales 来突出某个条件也很有用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1e86fd5de109d445",
      "translationZh": "Canny 条件",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd99fd4ccb6ef629",
      "translationZh": "原图",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "464fe5091640fa4d",
      "translationZh": "准备条件",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "27fc3e98a1d1c4ff",
      "translationZh": "Openpose 条件",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd99fd4ccb6ef629",
      "translationZh": "原图",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "464fe5091640fa4d",
      "translationZh": "准备条件",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aae076b136e3bf98",
      "translationZh": "用多个条件运行 ControlNet",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb7f11d22272d925",
      "translationZh": "通过这些例子，我们探索了 StableDiffusionControlNetPipeline 的多个侧面，展示了用 Diffusers 玩转 ControlNet 是多么简单直观。不过我们并没有覆盖 ControlNet 支持的所有条件类型。想了解更多，欢迎查阅各自的模型文档页：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "79b194d6aa8ca469",
      "translationZh": "lllyasviel/sd-controlnet-depth",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
