    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b788bb92309f129",
      "translationZh": "lllyasviel/sd-controlnet-canny",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f86cebde6d8a3920",
      "translationZh": "欢迎组合这些不同元素，并把你的成果分享给 @diffuserslib。别忘了打开 Colab Notebook，把上面的例子跑一遍！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b978b154f7f896a",
      "translationZh": "我们还展示了一些让生成更快、更省内存的技巧：快速调度器、智能模型卸载和 xformers。这些技术组合起来，在 V100 GPU 上单张图像的生成只要约 3 秒、显存仅约 4GB ⚡️ 在 Google Colab 这类免费服务上，默认 GPU（T4）生成约 5 秒，而原始实现要 17 秒才能得到同样结果！把 diffusers 工具箱里的零件组合起来，就是一种真正的超能力 💪",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc5ad83163f59971",
      "translationZh": "我们把 StableDiffusionControlNetPipeline 玩了个遍，体验非常有趣！我们期待看到社区在这个 pipeline 上构建的东西。想了解 Diffusers 支持的其他可控生成 pipeline 与技术，请看我们的官方文档。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "448aa62c0678b013",
      "translationZh": "如果你等不及想直接上手 ControlNet，我们也为你准备好了！点击以下任意 Space 即可把玩 ControlNet：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
